{"Map-Title":"06: Machinations","Map-Author":"Darkademic","Map-Categories-Mission":"Campaign","Map-Briefing":"Soviet activity in the area is increasing rapidly. They have ordered a large detachment of troops and supplies via Nod, likely preparing for a significant operation.\n\nIntel suggests that Nod have established a lab in the area to study captured Allied technology. The lab likely contains valuable intelligence that could give us the edge we need.\n\nDestroy the Soviet radar outposts and any other forces in the area, and capture the Nod research facility."}
